      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'To put an ingrediant into the cauldron , select iit with the mouse and
    click on the cauldron that puts it inside, you can select herbs and in the same
    fashion select the mortar and pestle to grind them into powder.

    you can
    also control wether you want the fire to be on or off.

    In this game time
    doesnt move unless you turn the hourglass , each turn counts as a cycle so when
    you want to boil the contents of the cauldron for one turn just turn thhe fire
    on and spin the hour glass once and if you want it to cool for that cycle , turn
    the fire off and spin it.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
